# Verbatim mirror: no line-ending conversion, in either direction.
#
# The resource files in here were hashed against the files the game and the
# server actually load, and several are claimed byte-identical to them. Any
# eol normalisation would silently invalidate those hashes, and a checkout
# would no longer reproduce the artifact that was tested.
#
# Consequence worth knowing: these files are CRLF, and that is deliberate.
* -text
